msgid "⟦SEP_0002⟧ [C2. Make the constraint real](⟦DEST_0001⟧) ⟦SEP_0003⟧ Write a check that bans loop words in Forth. ⟦SEP_0004⟧ It must strip comments and strings, then fail on each mutation. ⟦SEP_0005⟧"
